{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（18日）下午1時38分，警方接報指，粉嶺華明邨富明樓一單位廚房起火。消防到場撲救，約12分鐘後將火救熄。據知單位內有雜物起火，一家四口安全逃生，10多名住戶自行疏散，暫無受傷報告，救護車在場戒備。</p><p>從網上圖片可見，可見一個單位火光熊熊，湧出大量黑煙。</p><figure><img alt=\"從網上圖片可見，可見一個單位火光熊熊，湧出大量黑煙。（香港_北區之友 Friends of North District HK(上水、粉嶺、沙頭角和打鼓嶺)/Edmond Lee圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199733042889887744315947.jpeg/lPDLK_e6As_qHtMbqlHSRCvlycRXskXrtO3_GrTt_xo\"/><figcaption>從網上圖片可見，可見一個單位火光熊熊，湧出大量黑煙。（香港_北區之友 Friends of North District HK(上水、粉嶺、沙頭角和打鼓嶺)/Edmond Lee圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T10:44:10.735669+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":221,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:42:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T14:57:45.039182+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T10:37:40.353740+00:00","content_hash":"26eabde7b97c6a06502aab584ce04f8f125f49efc1fe2636796f326f87a6055c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}